---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Cookies — FerrFlow"
  description="ferrflow.com sets no cookie of its own. Period."
  lang="en"
  canonical="https://ferrflow.com/cookies"
  pathname="/cookies"
  lastUpdated="2026-05-01"
>
  <span slot="heading">Cookies — <em>FerrFlow</em></span>
  <p>
    ferrflow.com sets <strong>no cookie of its own</strong>. The only mechanism in use
    is the browser <code>localStorage</code> for remembering your language preference.
  </p>
  <p>
    No analytics cookie. No marketing tracker. No third-party script.
  </p>
  <p>
    The CLI itself is offline software — no cookies, no network calls beyond what you
    explicitly invoke.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you sign in to your FerrLabs account at <code>app.ferrlabs.com</code>, the
    <a href="https://ferrlabs.com/cookies">canonical FerrLabs cookie policy</a> applies
    there.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top:48px;font-size:13px;">
    French version: <a href="/fr/cookies">Cookies</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
